One Oracle note

Because we are using oracledb Thin mode, this line:

dsn = "ces_tst"

depends on your Oracle networking configuration.

If it fails with something like:

DPY-4027: no configuration directory specified

we will point it directly to your tnsnames.ora.

Your earlier log showed:

C:\oracle\product\12.1.0\client_1

so we can configure:

oracledb.defaults.config_dir = r"C:\oracle\product\12.1.0\client_1\network\admin"

if needed.

